{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Record what is happening on the screen:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Program sequences including mouse movements and text input, film clips from the Internet, games, video calls and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You choose which area you want to record - whether it's a specific window, any section or even full screen mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recording audio tracks and microphone streams is child's play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Some highlights at a glance</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super easy to use</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely selectable recording area</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound can be recorded with an internal or external microphone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practical timer and cursor functions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Record videos of different quality: 4K UHD, HD, SD and much more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supported output formats: WMV, MP4 (video) and MP3, WMA, AAC, M4A (audio)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easily record videos on your computer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Record audio sources or record your own speech with the microphone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ideal for creating your own video tutorials, game captures &amp; online films</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3739610?t=1749373933","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3739610?t=1749373933","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739610/87dff7bfee7e0ae50d7ec44e6fd48d9aa050fb2c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749373933","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739610/87dff7bfee7e0ae50d7ec44e6fd48d9aa050fb2c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749373933","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Record what is happening on the screen:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Program sequences including mouse movements and text input, film clips from the Internet, games, video calls and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You choose which area you want to record - whether it's a specific window, any section or even full screen mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recording audio tracks and microphone streams is child's play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Some highlights at a glance</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super easy to use</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely selectable recording area</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound can be recorded with an internal or external microphone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practical timer and cursor functions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Record videos of different quality: 4K UHD, HD, SD and much more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supported output formats: WMV, MP4 (video) and MP3, WMA, AAC, M4A (audio)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easily record videos on your computer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Record audio sources or record your own speech with the microphone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ideal for creating your own video tutorials, game captures &amp; online films</p></li></ul>","developers":["magnussoft"],"genres":[{"description":"Audio Production","id":"52"},{"description":"Utilities","id":"57"},{"description":"Video Production","id":"58"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739610/38acc0a8b2deda8b169f2828b8a258d8f22a49a8/header.jpg?t=1749373933","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recomme